              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mavis Greene Tobin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was delicious! A very nice change from the run of the mill swordfish. I broiled the swordfish in the house, and it was perfect! My husband said this recipe is a \"keeper\"! I agree!",
